{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game about open world survival and construction, where players will gradually complete the game process with the support of gameplay such as building, fighting monsters, upgrading, exploring the world, resource management, etc., and ultimately complete the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Procedurally Generated Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/extras/2025-03-28_20-35-10.mp4_20250328_232552.852.jpg?t=1743176515\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/extras/\u5996\u7cbe\u6811\u5c4b\u5185\u90e8.png?t=1743176515\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Logging and Gathering</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/extras/2025-03-28_20-23-35.mp4_20250328_233435.581.jpg?t=1743176515\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/extras/2025-03-28_20-23-35.mp4_20250328_233443.478.jpg?t=1743176515\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Excavation and Construction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/extras/2025-03-28_20-23-35.mp4_20250328_233459.949.jpg?t=1743176515\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/extras/2025-03-28_20-23-35.mp4_20250328_233535.869.jpg?t=1743176515\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Item Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/extras/2025-03-28_20-23-35.mp4_20250328_232734.093.jpg?t=1743176515\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dungeons and Mining</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/extras/\u5730\u7262.png?t=1743176515\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character Attributes and Injury Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/extras/2025-03-28_20-23-35.mp4_20250328_233520.517.jpg?t=1743176515\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/extras/2025-03-28_20-23-35.mp4_20250328_232744.909.jpg?t=1743176515\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Regarding the official version</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The official version will feature the following characteristics:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The complete main storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four procedurally generated overworld maps for each region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated dungeons corresponding to the distinctive houses in each region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mobs corresponding to the races of each region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At least 8 additional bosses to be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different weather conditions that can affect the state of the terrain and environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terrain and environmental conditions that can influence crop growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An increased variety of constructible buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A greater number of craftable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Implementation of character ability points, attributes, and the functionality of food elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A more comprehensive system for managing character injuries and illnesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shops with a wider array of goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More and more complete quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhanced art and music sound effects.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3159790?t=1743176515","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3159790?t=1743176515","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/a2b9721c65f8ce97d4681723a0075b9dd2bb51cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743176515","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/a2b9721c65f8ce97d4681723a0075b9dd2bb51cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743176515","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game about open world survival and construction, where players will gradually complete the game process with the support of gameplay such as building, fighting monsters, upgrading, exploring the world, resource management, etc., and ultimately complete the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Procedurally Generated Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/extras/2025-03-28_20-35-10.mp4_20250328_232552.852.jpg?t=1743176515\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/extras/\u5996\u7cbe\u6811\u5c4b\u5185\u90e8.png?t=1743176515\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Logging and Gathering</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/extras/2025-03-28_20-23-35.mp4_20250328_233435.581.jpg?t=1743176515\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati