ding to the distinctive houses in each region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mobs corresponding to the races of each region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At least 8 additional bosses to be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different weather conditions that can affect the state of the terrain and environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terrain and environmental conditions that can influence crop growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An increased variety of constructible buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A greater number of craftable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Implementation of character ability points, attributes, and the functionality of food elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A more comprehensive system for managing character injuries and illnesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shops with a wider array of goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More and more complete quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhanced art and music sound effects.</p>","developers":["\u6e10\u51ac"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159790/31eb2d60a20441eb38823fe662e0366fd082466d/header.jpg?t=1743176515","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116608,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116608/movie480.mp4?t=1742579941","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116608/movie_max.mp4?t=1742579941"},"name":"first","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116